    {
      "uid": "zhcn:263c097ff9993791bedd5edf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "每个人都在努力。\n每个人心中都怀着斗志。\n理所当然地，成为应有的模样。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd238525676b1ae71b109e5e9b5b4bae97e7ac7dd3c3972115d1a25cb7b2aa21",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
