    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3fabb375094b1de037ca9011",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "正因如此。寄宿在我身上的东西，\n再寻常不过，绝非什么特别之物――",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bddda5474046b2f25d98565814aea8d3de00b3b4c4de51a1faa83a9e35198ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111105.json",
      "json_path": [
